@startuml
title Configure Action Sequence

actor User
participant CLI
participant Pyroform
participant PyroformEngine
participant PyroParser
participant SketchGenerator
participant PyroflowEngine
participant FlowEngine

User -> CLI: configure -i config.yaml
CLI -> Pyroform: configure(input_path)
Pyroform -> PyroformEngine: configure(input_path)
PyroformEngine -> PyroParser: parse(input_path)
PyroParser -> PyroParser: _parse_single_file()/_parse_directory()
PyroParser --> PyroformEngine: List[PyroConfig]
loop for each config
  PyroformEngine -> SketchGenerator: generate_configure_sketch(config)
  SketchGenerator -> CommandGenerator: generate_user_command()
  SketchGenerator -> CommandGenerator: generate_group_command()
  SketchGenerator -> CommandGenerator: generate_device_commands()
  SketchGenerator --> PyroformEngine: FlowCTRL sketch
  PyroformEngine -> PyroflowEngine: execute_sketch(sketch)
  PyroflowEngine -> FlowEngine: load_procedure()
  PyroflowEngine -> FlowEngine: start_procedure()
  FlowEngine --> PyroflowEngine: execution_result
  PyroflowEngine --> PyroformEngine: success/failure
end
PyroformEngine --> Pyroform: ConfigureResult
Pyroform --> CLI: Result
CLI --> User: Success/Failure
@enduml
